OL,3,GNEWSACompetition to get crafty with
OL,4,Acans to reduce waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools and community groups are being
OL,7,Fencouraged to collect old aluminium
OL,8,Fcans and turn them into pieces of art.
OL,10,FPeterborough City Council has come up
OL,11,Fwith the idea of the Every Can Counts
OL,12,Fcompetition to encourage recycling of
OL,13,Fthe cans and raise awareness of its
OL,14,Fimportance to the environment.
OL,16,FThe authority said the UK used about 10
OL,17,Fbillion cans a year, which is
OL,18,Fequivalent to 600 per household, but
OL,19,Fthe recycling process used just 5% of
OL,20,Fthe energy needed to create new
OL,21,Faluminium.
