OL,3,GNEWSACompetition to get crafty with
OL,4,Acans to reduce waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe competition closes in May and
OL,7,Fentrants have been asked to create
OL,8,Fsomething that is 3D, free-standing,
OL,9,Feasily transportable and centred on the
OL,10,Ftheme of Our Earth, Our Planet.
